  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> are two matrices of order <math><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>,&nbsp;then <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
